Pelikan is one of the nicest and smartest professors I have ever had at Mizzou, he just unfortunately got stuck teaching such a boring class. 
Exams count for 96 percent of your grade, however, you can drop the lowest exam and get an AUTOMATIC 100% on his final by doing the &#8220;Power up assignments&#8221; 
If you're willing to put in the time, Easy A.
